<title>UK: London offshore tea auction offerings.</title>
<headline>London offshore tea auction offerings.</headline>
<text>
<p>Offshore offering for the Aug 4 London Tea Auction Totalled 1,000 packages of 53.50 kgs against 1,400 pkgs on July 28.</p>
<p>							   Last	  Prev</p>
<p>Kenya O/Sh Pkgs	    CIF   Offshore	 600	   nil</p>
<p>Malawi O/Sh Pkgs	   CIF   Offshore	 200	   nil</p>
<p>Zimba. O/Sh Pkgs	   CIF   Offshore	 200	 1,400</p>
<p>Aug 4 landed packages already listed totalled 3,999.</p>
